Package: rlme
Type: Package
Title: Rank-Based Estimation and Prediction in Random Effects Nested
        Models
Version: 0.5.9001
Author: Yusuf Bilgic [aut, cre], Herb Susmann [aut], Joseph McKean [aut]
Maintainer: Yusuf Bilgic <bilgic@geneseo.edu>
